      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784134946140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FB Live Comments\nFacebook Live Comments is a feature that enables viewers to post comments on a live video feed. \nViewers can see a continuous stream of comments in near-real-time.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FB Live Comments\nFacebook Live Comments is a feature that enables viewers to post comments on a live video feed. \nViewers can see a continuous stream of comments in near-real-time.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CtkazAKs9ZS4Clp7FQw2x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -42411.21888605214,
      "y": -6712.270083148951,
      "width": 558.53955078125,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 655736230,
      "version": 459,
      "versionNonce": 780580390,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784132289325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Viewers can post comments\n- Viewers can see all comments posted in near realtime\n- Viewers can see all comments posted before they joined\n\n----------- Below the line ------------\n- interactions to comments\n\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Scale to millions of viewers per video\n- Availability > consistency\n- Low latency comment broadcast (~200ms)\n\n----------- Below the line ------------\n- security\n- integrity\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Viewers can post comments\n- Viewers can see all comments posted in near realtime\n- Viewers can see all comments posted before they joined\n\n----------- Below the line ------------\n- interactions to comments\n\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Scale to millions of viewers per video\n- Availability > consistency\n- Low latency comment broadcast (~200ms)\n\n----------- Below the line ------------\n- security\n- integrity\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
